  "description": "Phase 2 (2019 - 2024) Statewide LiDAR-derived Digital Elevation Model.\n\nThis is the KyFromAbove Phase2 collection and provides access to a 2 Foot Digital Elevation Model (DEM) for Kentucky. LiDAR was collected at Quality Level 2 or better from 2019 - 2024 for Kentucky Aerial Photography and Elevation Data (KYAPED) project areas while no snow was on the ground and rivers were at or below normal levels.",
